{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e80bba71715fafe204eb950ccafbc7cef41c0f5b9793f7361d4fad7ca51c51de458b53e89c730d602b5101d8573619214fcb3580b40e18e1d83222794119ae6a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5b3e9ce63dfe6d17c535338bf34d1e01e22387be1771818a600058c7776b5a37ae11d5ab06373f2272a4e569cfc8cfbb6691c22fe17f983d4ce742b204ace3824207c54978c0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bf85ab684b8334dfb9aafb9d7b94cf04183746c1f61f404c6d9b04fccad122509566e7e5f1078e145339b85c7042e73b332507635e084f177f3aaf8678a37d8ab2e6a91b5258217693c9ee33fc188cb26ae984ab47173d4adb5baba2db4b26085e3ce72ddf854086f480f5e992feb8c70354eb4e6a97e796\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ceebbf87ab437448dbe7dc20a652e7e57b997beda3ff4f574e7f7fa672569cd635e73cabd11bec04777e41f64a6bcb644095af66cde6ac70ac2c449b78604e4dd266fbfb6ad101641f893efd87341b825c5ea2b7d5ddd5175af097ba545e29526e763d88a04b29f0b0e15a0a0e06d6b16451047adea4e735\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ecb6940cfcfc9f544af4d1a5a40b1154b725754a027d33132aaffa0e4f73dc2c4c424b7d92edafab86739bd78ef82d9de4079c346f3f088a65c2b603ce2876b62414336cae6ceeaf4c3d2ef3894c0f891811f6e56078cfcee96de68055c86ca832f43d3786ef42eef58c2327632ee57c38fc6962764b93fe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/17922275be5e3032cd3bfbcb4827df4b1f05500d4b94a827fff33db4548f5485884753a163edcca0486e9f8de2d7265ef2048eb3332292d8140bc305d4ea87eba17b0d2c7e8c4c45f3583b3e0f6c07b032bdad2c054d4ee62eb0bcee91b402b8acb14ea863abf75909832ce1b152c7ceee155cb67f037e4f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ff7ee6a79a2c6f5c3548b807fd18a4c9535a568ba36dc60b4633a6ff2cb76a0433dbbfd5ec0b3695707b7e7a3f62ff6c285e06e84aa06d24c84656137e12e698a1603346a2a82757ca2104e1cf562b281d549028db54a64e8734640468a894538101419d2f03cc2455b487769b8d2ecbaeff0b10531fbb5b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f331173d14a2f6d6e7ef97bdb28a7116efd53b83a22f0574cbbfdb397531c101592a3481d739c1d2d26595d107f8176ba49a84\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e67e6a49182bc05114e2641ff39186aa6974b53d16a969232084e40038b3e3e91b65a69c9d40d4e2cf242d0ab14aef860ad2a00375a1a00bf9f74f03af60b157a6a246e6e04994481ff0df8dbcfd00dc5be4957f0d1b2b48ed5d9e298fac98054d1fecd5fcd648b00678e3039845ddb4b1d2a8c111b3e55c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2519b185b7aaa0f5c0509989a741d86894085ab78f400601f65fea7b16411c935d61b9ed15e130bfc4fc0cdea68538ccbd9bfa96448b4dcffd399e9d40bfb47499d3fe664583f0bdd7f4d87089e73811d08faff6ee7cfcb6d4a5c63e6fc54f862177b2e09a5cbcb46c814e5f4d7691a67b832eb7171a4e6d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1e737e012d39955bc2fb827bcd6bc4f2bb3a899feb059404242b04d9cc55ef70392a083aa35203fa4b3058b8c266dc129d9e7d2e8fae398ed184dc549b8d3c7ff3554b03a54747ccaac5305868b5f9dacf44c79b95da1887a198968004084ed334561aac75674ef87fe2afa5b73cc02ba2e4795d8d611e3b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/504108d99427f954a59e23b1503b0d3fedb8a217271c75ebe9bee56cfc3d4e58630da8215dbb0109114b54b3dd9c39dda67c0be9487fada5c742544a68af6a038f676197c5839f8d4a28ffed3de8bd7c56fc8a38f2468e3260ee048aa8273e457d0f51d5ebdd11dfd85feb9cc7adfc16d896e52a9fd80c43\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e18068f648a5bc95ae431cc6a72a2741e01e4d8f488e9ad43ccefd0383e5008fc10cada12db4fb8b52f56526b08659d8fd741a2fe25effe61aecae33b2bdbb69666c34b9a3571e2ae6936ef8b3f73b7fa55673bfdf528564730b5fd071ccdfa0540b42242c73b7238d295977deb4507836237dbeb0b23b89\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/48d12008f12f48cbef24f1637e607d44904f0189f1272f863a323c36b51bcf7558371ab35269c4367ed56fe4accdbf9bfcf6f08497076b07a1b0ea4726bea8962887251b88646ec5fef3251024d49a62659fbed4a86fffc68ac3289dde4db5f976df30469a269d096b1b51ad15a0fb57b1629ad8ced4ad22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dab0bf58c42cfadebd7de2b288008c17c61b01bf41e40e15c32170ec1eebfd51f2e2501ce0240a2394b43b0687d715400f3f834fe47fdf60698176cdd154e586c019d2a8d149fafdff081d8db866acfdc1071b9bebb7eddd91d8c662fa07cceac72c773f74ac0c37faf10a6fc9d6bfa213f674ac164f1e8c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/485d6fac5ee0465bed154138f45277c359f65821daaf505529f90255f6505d67622ec4be84b3da76542683e68eaa56b89fb91aa9190c686001004c793b3eec9e343a121def579c16889a2391fd76517266a8886d96f89d1c1b3116934f61d35a48f5b76f7bb70aeeaeec65eb5aa685792aef1a4311cbaebf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/28e6e30ac30ecfc50a07b44b2b0c2d7fc4827fb8ed6750ac4a7026f9d87ad430fc3a93c8e6244fbb517cdf13e0aad59d91dae5285b30b3b271f632a596ca5193835044e207fe092cd548346c431d49f292c8432c4413c36414d1a5e5007dcadb0229ca1811a2ded02516f8b0e9e0859f04e0e57186c201a7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b2fff0a481d73809ff9d7f7a61f5260b0c38d76ed16132b2c390830b3c1b2dadc0be7031da2fa8b9b550741139c495bbe8888692cdd96a060586fac63d215615fba97c0b9e4b33d3b79d298e6641058d322f57aee481cb00a68915d2587861b6c9c47639c33dce77d610e3d4dc82ee2dcac6b5c720fe6c5f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/50d12643ae29da1ff1bbb352415b9938aeacb51fc22debb068aab97a66588eef5863fef9d2f73940a092751f22242ea724bbf857e238375c0627408837a2f0126166ee3711df4e12b90734580430607b1adb27f6453f23ed06cd14d04aea21af31b597f20ce17625e9e475f2fbd23904aa93c1bec2b56e55\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ec291f2384e2ec37bf08851313ed7660367d9d9e7e1008cd4a61e29078226103c359948fd4ee9293ff34753345c9a73e0bf8797172a5a9d485108449fabed726a4754e5f625fc24f715b9e8b750a4cb78bd4e95e80e88640eed4aad860687536594de424c9c8338ada610e3c71686992fbb1e67def9baa21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5d28656f09fcb6adb35bbd275b68a4aba037577ecd561a3f2b82384c89ce9e52e63a9ecf55de0ec2bc64538e9fb2f9132ba75828be60348eed5232a70d1aac2d769c945ef74569c9790c8f47d03efeb3de5b7b444eef139f7ec63017e253e3fda5847697c4973a2be6eea295c93a70ffb078695c500cdc80\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/727116a2374da0d2e1e1b45667f80e5670424c53a286d0474c6965a13f4ccbb494accaf5e07cde586477558df8a7b8fcc45c9cb883ace4be9db14b6b2cc8c262c9b06d0a25cad15f5231ac894f0425b4b5daf4e7728e2de1bc40c53827d44f3d7888bf691ff002a629d89c6210acae62eb3a1233b205ab49\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/65b82a7a55934b9f9ea65b985483a92e94214b53dd7dc90a9bb1c56e73dda2054cba843c2e788e9866030306673f5dafcc32aa85f74d1c170d4f27855ae7c1ffabcbf1610db0251b2c92257925555e75d35673e285196c28b732e521f6a86ff17a0449c2df6e71d20f53fea1d2a847fcd2c1f25983a2265b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2b65386779c548bfbbac8f31f9661342de18cef80a53b64a075d65b3708b40742d1ee476c37e551ce1e1d05802ba7e1b0423b3c227793caad8fb1794d5cd96acc5cba48095254d1e990b0817c4ee685d84edcf6106de581c14cf7f0ac515683ed879f8ec556b889d82a7c299c368c5af01228e06f9f85d4f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4dedede34ea11da0ba9ed5adda195d7025b94299d8adab5faef445c965509ba6db3a1fd9aa2b500c49767f05f17a2dd29ea200b18622f27743baee23498fe898fd0f32e959b933afb61842bddc9ee3bd124ac9b0ffc633a078d059a0c54ac84f6bc0aed6d8bda860fe6fd1e37e6f9effc6f12808f3af49f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cad2504c635b4fe4ed480fc664efc4fbd5fe707c0711efc2638d88970fb7879540bedc4f2c0fe96f24e776fe993dcb845ba178a0b36d98a71503d9a944f0c1b5f46ecd54413d4f75a849c4eb9fb997282bbc215bd0dbfba15ca44f09fd6975d023590fc82d05c6c1bb3a8baa546f655cea106be4ac59ef24\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/48730a2e91a44b9bd9bb5f9955c4b27702d80cd5159f3c57ec1b8f2a8fa6825742e21936bbdd54e1a0030c806df90b3dd79318d736e0127a2f16e94db3ac17763b7b635e8be762c8f701900e49cd5470a7979eba544625d570c1d3da33f17c3c22b9f5a7a8946c40d199e9f0fbff4166f173d80f9174e65f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0b9c847ff022b092a88f26c47d4711b97ffeaab8a2568734bc322b349aa8f8240e45be6c62ffb0e518a575a1e3fd54db1bb8ff9682c2368d483e6ad7e71d225b9c540f9ed76f08ac8ffdd9fa6321699508ec8422fc51e1e3e6c5be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dc06cc6d414bcd2dc6d7b85cb7f59404932cd53f51ac0621e526b734f96154fa7a046b9843c0deb077ccf386ad8da8aeb2d78987fa8eaf608fce85c25745e89b763b1753de66945bf05c1f630d3a790030fd341c8189789a3100bfffdbab467c480bf5ca64ccc5e08ee6dc5392bb3d83691c85137dcd0f85\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c698da5f894490d468352cb8bc5a6cc6a4acb8cdf4a43f61b309f4f27471b1878aca9624146de1b3acab9ac3d5a6d6967013274b89e15271f0a577229abd8334191aa738b54229910bb1e54b34ae6e649d757d81c2832fcc45afd10e4343c126dec6ef4f3167d0f39cc514082f26655d20633d6d80998dbe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3745be1772d38cd44b42530cc72aa637b8ff01279713d41551c828875eed14603b6b2e47c640df7aad88d7bccb05517de13f94428d07d1d3396f5aea55595f4fd7746619d7e285830b887e7f94f9192686140131bdd600e646983b86922bfbf5ac41cdafa0a80d1c6aa73446aac381211c5da638b02cdbc3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f0293332835da567eaeac03e8a747bf937facf0aadab4ef638de4db5bcf96fb596905bf2f2aba54d3390d92efa895d38e79991a41eaf15edddedee926081d49de9a353dc1f89c018cb3d233e7ee91fe3e015553902b5f0ff0d11ce8d6521a20f4a6c2aad6d637048b6b02a1155b527dbe781aafeda53e3a7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/51873eb854ddbd123e428d7352c0dc632f96da17f98f3eb940e773e24b74fdb8b026a6c682e631b3459e696e3061da524d92b29b3ce0d74ae5875b7377e54a9621ef1a24cfae5f186bab9443559b995d2d786384c0bdd7d1365505c2630318086e1799d4af23aee9b6f27262f40d2c7d4d4e3f12689fc2b8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b37508ab39da92b1de0adf0491067e80ac32ce4708d341b3265385379aaa9cc1d57fb607f1d1ce1c29380d7d407ba9be2a778291c68815005175cc44b9d218f3a68a30d959a637334d2a4f74d679fe34b7be7f5271a83b839d5fa7ad1445d1ac0af4f3d3ef6cd69f78d7c512da47f28dcfa08df78f61ca1a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3e2f85be2477dfb57d978e6315133e8c12d2ecd29814f97d72a48fcfa48e7c2108ada3d79a5241e9af1e409d63d6bbc3f3704619ebdc6ca7e2edab5bba3d407f8888cc9b4a13240eba0dcce9e53b8c2f9ab1157397127e42eb830b0e9fe50d365dfa14c7e85284a987b26f8036c6f4dbcc93aeebd9509077\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
